@host = http://localhost:5151
@merchant = 11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111

### Create a payment (re-sending the same Idempotency-Key returns the same payment)
POST {{host}}/api/v1/payments
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: demo-key-001
X-Merchant-Id: {{merchant}}

{
  "amount": 12.50,
  "currency": "USD",
  "paymentMethodToken": "tok_visa_demo",
  "description": "Order 1001"
}

### Get a payment (replace the id)
GET {{host}}/api/v1/payments/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
X-Merchant-Id: {{merchant}}

### Readiness
GET {{host}}/health/ready

### List plans
GET {{host}}/api/v1/subscription-plans

### Buy a plan (Basic, Classic or Gold). Use a token starting with tok_decline to see a 402.
POST {{host}}/api/v1/subscriptions
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: sub-demo-001
X-Merchant-Id: {{merchant}}

{
  "plan": "Gold",
  "paymentMethodToken": "tok_visa_demo"
}

### Current subscription (404 while locked)
GET {{host}}/api/v1/subscriptions/current
X-Merchant-Id: {{merchant}}

### Gated example endpoints (403 until the plan is bought)
GET {{host}}/api/v1/membership/gold
X-Merchant-Id: {{merchant}}
